      "function": "glimmer",
      "anchor": "if lc.is_busy(self) then",
      "condition": "lc.is_busy ; for i, j in -1..1 ; i ~= 0 or j ~= 0",
      "semantic": "GLIMMER fires a sprinkle in each of the eight directions (every direction but none), each marked to freeze a quarter as long, prepays their weapon cost within its own price, costs an attack pause, refuses a busy faerie, and puts her aim back truncated to whole pixels (C int temps). A direction whose launch pad a live body blocks becomes a melee attack() on that body (fire() returns nil, so no KIT_QUARTER_FREEZE mark) and the burst goes on.",
      "arms": [
        {
          "when": "busy",
          "observable": "'SPECIAL BUSY', 0 MP"
        },
        {
          "when": "idle, open field",
          "observable": "8 sprinkles with KIT_QUARTER_FREEZE, 40 MP net, busy += fire_frequency"
        },
        {
          "when": "idle, a fractional aim (lastx 2.83 after a diagonal walk)",
          "observable": "lastx after the cast == 2.0 (truncated, unlike knife_fan which keeps it whole)"
        },
        {
          "when": "idle, a body touching one side (point-blank)",
          "observable": "7 sprinkles in weaplist, no quarter-freeze on the touched body; a melee attack() is resolved on the touching body (walker::fire() melee arm, walker.cpp:606-635): if attack() returns true (a living foe, not invincible, not cancelled by a level on_damage hook) a SOUND_CLANG event and an hp drop of the rolled amount (base-damage jitter minus random(armor), walker_combat.cpp get_base_damage/compute_damage_reduction; may be 0); if it returns false (friendly, dead, invincible, treasure, gate-cancelled) no CLANG and no hp change. Certain either way: the shot is consumed (weapon dead, not in weaplist), the attacker's myguy total_shots/scen_shots +1, and the MP already charged is not refunded; mp still -40"
        }
      ],
      "setting": "new-specials",
      "status": "partial",
      "tests": [
        {
          "file": "tests/unit/test_kit_faerie.cpp",
          "test": "KitFaerie.glimmer_fires_eight_sprinkles_and_prepays"
        },
        {
          "file": "tests/unit/test_kit_faerie.cpp",
          "test": "KitFaerie.glimmer_sprinkle_freezes_a_quarter"
        }
      ],
      "missing_arms": [
        "idle, a fractional aim (lastx 2.83 after a diagonal walk)",
        "idle, a body touching one side (point-blank)"
      ],
      "note": [
        "unasserted: aim restored truncated (the test uses lastx=1, lasty=0 so truncation is invisible)",
        "unasserted: point-blank blocked-pad melee arm"
      ]
    },
